<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Wednesday's matches:</p>
<p>17 - Ian Wright (Arsenal), Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>12 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool), Les Ferdinand (Newcastle)</p>
<p>Dwight Yorke (Aston Villa)</p>
<p>11 - Ole Gunnar Solskjaer (Manchester United)</p>
<p>10 - Matt Le Tissier (Southampton), Fabrizio Ravanelli</p>
<p>(Middlesbrough)</p>
<p>9 - Efan Ekoku (Wimbledon), Chris Sutton (Blackburn)</p>
</text>
